    "body": "Follow-up to the review above (post-merge record). The runner run finished after the PR merged.\n\nRun https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/43617268075 (main 1f6a74be): conclusion `failure`, step \"Quick gate on the merged tree\".\n```\nok      50s  post suites\nFAIL  1329s  app suites  failed:\nwall 23.0 min, 2 step(s), 1 failed\n```\nThe log does not name the failing binaries. The PR body says two `lead_approach` tests fail on main without this PR (#1675). I could not confirm that those are the only failures. Clippy ran after the gate step. I did not read its result.\n\nPlease check the run's gate-logs artifact to confirm that the failures are only the known `lead_approach` tests.\n",
